note v1.4 interop demo: talk to any WordPress site over its REST API.
note Usage: python3 jesun.py examples/wp_client_demo.jc [base-url]
note Defaults to the public WordPress demo API (read-only calls).

bring in "wordpress"

base is "https://demo.wp-api.org/wp-json"
if length of arguments is greater than 0 then
    base is arguments[0]

site is wp_site with base and nothing and nothing
show "Talking to " + site["base"]

posts is wp_posts with site and 3
for each p in posts
    show wp_rendered with p["title"]
    show "  " + p["link"]

found is wp_search with site and "hello"
show "Search found " + (text of (length of found)) + " post(s) mentioning hello."
